'''Kalisa''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] event. She was added in [[Version 3.2 Update|Version 3.2]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]] increases her attack power and range. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]] increases health and range and grants 20% chance for an [[Explosion]], as well as [[Wave Immunity]] and [[Weaken Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]].

