==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Kalisa was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Infernal Power (Removed Combo)|Infernal Power]] and [[Showing Leg (Removed Combo)|Showing Leg]].
*The χ in her Evolved Form's name is the Greek letter "chi" (pronounced like kai).
*[[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]] added the Greek letters to the English True Form names of all [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Galaxy Gals]] except for Kalisa. Hers was added later in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]].
*A running gag in her Japanese descriptions is the amount of destruction she causes. Kalisa nearly destroyed her school, [[Tropical Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Tropical Kalisa]] nearly destroyed a beach hut, and [[Floral Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Floral Kalisa]] destroyed both a spring festival venue and all the eggs at an egg hunt.
*[[Seashore Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Seashore Kai]]'s English description says that Kalisa is the one who dragged her to the beach for the first time in years.
*Kalisa resembles [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event|Hatsune Miku]], a popular [[Wikipedia:Vocaloid|VOCALOID]].
**In her [[True Form]], Kalisa's outfit looks like that of [[wikia:vocaloid:Hatsune Miku Append|Miku's Append version]].
**In her [[Ultra Form]], feathers are added and her hair can be seen slowly turning blue, resembling [[Hatsune Miku XVI (Uber Rare Cat)|Hatsune Miku XVI]].
*Kalisa's True Form was called "Kalisa, Type χχ" in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]]. It was quickly changed in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]] of [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]], but in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] her name still has the "χχ" in it.
*Kalisa, Type χ's name in Japanese makes a pun on the legendary sword [[wikipedia:Excalibur|Excalibur]].
**'''エクスカリバー''' ''Ekusukaribā'' (Excalibur) → '''Χカリファ''' ''Ekusu Karifa'' (Χ Karifa)
**Her Normal Form's Japanese description reveals the name of her sword: Nyaxcalibur, a portmanteau of ''nya'' (an onomatopoeia for a cat's meow) and ''Excalibur''.
*Tropical Kalisa's Japanese description reveals that she was sealed in the underworld during the spring, which may be why Floral Kalisa seems to dislike this season.

